ttps://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"application/json\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":838,\"digest\":\"sha256:d988023dae9bb9d6a8d0820139cfa5f8b9f06c023804f82cacd7ecf6dfe8c08a\",\"download_count\":1,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-09T17:27:11Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T17:27:11Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1/tag-ci.json\"},{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/releases/assets/553121556\",\"id\":553121556,\"node_id\":\"RA_kwDOSs8nvc4g9_cU\",\"name\":\"ZENODO_HANDOFF_TR.md\",\"label\":\"\",\"uploader\":{\"login\":\"halvrenofviryel\",\"id\":246127299,\"node_id\":\"U_kgDODquaww\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246127299?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/halvrenofviryel/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"content_type\":\"text/markdown; charset=utf-8\",\"state\":\"uploaded\",\"size\":1585,\"digest\":\"sha256:8496a303a01d1ff4959378c4aabb0e651101d4fe27606fe9d780502cf0e1a1f2\",\"download_count\":2,\"created_at\":\"2026-09-09T16:15:10Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-09-09T16:15:10Z\",\"browser_download_url\":\"https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/releases/download/v0.2.0-beta.1/ZENODO_HANDOFF_TR.md\"}],\"tarball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/tarball/v0.2.0-beta.1\",\"zipball_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/zipball/v0.2.0-beta.1\",\"body\":\"AIREP v0.2.0-beta.1 is the **current v0.2 implementation target**, a usable beta prerelease. Artifact wire version remains `0.2`; frozen v0.1 remains supported.\\n\\nThis release adds a first-party Python library/CLI for Decision Receipt, Control Evidence, Execution Evidence and Effect Evidence; a real local Decision → dispatch → receiver receipt → Execution → Effect example; and mechanical cross-artifact reconciliation. It includes one normative entry point, AD-17 input admission, and r3 profile evaluation through Python/Node beta verifier adapters.\\n\\nStart here: [SPEC](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/blob/v0.2.0-beta.1/spec/airep/v0.2/SPEC.md) → [10-minute quickstart](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/blob/v0.2.0-beta.1/spec/airep/v0.2/QUICKSTART.md) → [verification](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/blob/v0.2.0-beta.1/spec/airep/v0.2/VERIFICATION.md) → [lifecycle example](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/tree/v0.2.0-beta.1/examples/v02).\\n\\nReconciliation retains **SATISFIED, FAILURE, MISSING, NOT_EVALUATED and INDETERMINATE**. Missing evidence never becomes PASS. Integrity and assurance classes do not establish report truth; a self-declared key cannot independently grant Authenticated.\\n\\nKnown limits: first-party producer only; public development keys; single-writer cursor; supplied-set reconciliation without total-history/target-coverage assurance. The example uses local test policy, not externally established independence. No same-version third-party v0.2 producer→consumer interoperability result exists. The earlier external v0.2 verifier result remains qualified on its historical r1 basis (17 AGREE / 1 DISAGREE; not expected-blind). This is **not stable** and does not claim deployment interoperability.\\n\\n[Release stages](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/blob/v0.2.0-beta.1/spec/airep/v0.2/RELEASE_STAGES.md) retain the independent producer/consumer and reproduction gates. Migration tooling and planned companion E2E work are outside beta.\\n\\nA **new beta version DOI is pending the maintainer's separate Zenodo publication**. The alpha DOI identifies only alpha and must not be used for this beta. Cite this release and its exact tag until the beta DOI is added.\\n\\nValidation on release commit `8a6c01ecce457aa94330c0ed7219e4c56ebfe771`:\\n\\n* [Hosted beta](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/actions/runs/34374032496): **51/51 commands passed**, including **39/39 beta tests**, Python/Node schema and class parity, lifecycle and quickstart; all 1,919 preserved historical files unchanged.\\n* [Frozen alpha reproduction](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/actions/runs/34374032453): passed.\\n* [v0.1 conformance](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/actions/runs/34374032190): Python 3.11/3.12 and TypeScript producer/dual-verifier job passed.\\n* Imported W1: Python 423 tests (one explicitly unmeasurable platform branch skipped); Node 2,329 assertions passed (complementary platform branch NOT_MEASURED). No independent beta interoperability claim follows from these first-party runs.\\n* The earlier [local 54-command measurement](https://github.com/halvrenofviryel/ai-runtime-evidence-protocol/blob/v0.2.0-beta.1/reports/beta-2026-09-08/TEST_COMMANDS.md) includes three TypeScript commands that hosted CI runs in the separate conformance job.\\n\\nSource tar/ZIP archives below each reproduce all 2,433 files of the exact tag tree. `airep-v0.2.0-beta.1-hosted-evidence.zip` retains full branch/PR/main run logs, final beta/alpha artifacts, source bases and command/result ledgers. `SHA256SUMS.txt` supplies download checksums; `PUBLICATION_REPORT_TR.md` records publication details; `ZENODO_HANDOFF_TR.md` supplies the separate DOI handoff. Documented public test seeds are intentional test material.\\n\"}"
